{"unit_id":"yangyunsong023__dsh-sxs-anti-bot-http#card-zh","repo":"yangyunsong023/dsh-sxs-anti-bot-http","commit":"5a956bf01da88fef35ae689d21feeded60c75261","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sxs-anti-bot-http 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的 HTTP 抓取插件，在 DSH tools 中注册网页与 JSON 请求工具。它轮换浏览器 User-Agent，支持 Referer、超时和网络失败重试，并识别常见验证码或安全验证页面。站点连续失败时会按退避时间等待，成功后重置状态；另有工具可查看各站点失败次数和剩余等待时间。适合通过 DSH 获取网页正文或 JSON API 内容的场景。调用时提供 URL，可选设置 Referer 和超时；代码没有定义 API 密钥或其他配置项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-16","lib/index.js:93-164","lib/index.js:170-277"]}
{"unit_id":"yangyunsong023__dsh-sxs-anti-bot-http#card-en","repo":"yangyunsong023/dsh-sxs-anti-bot-http","commit":"5a956bf01da88fef35ae689d21feeded60c75261","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sxs-anti-bot-http adds HTTP tools to DeepSeek Harness. It rotates browser User-Agent values, retries failed requests, detects common CAPTCHA pages, and backs off per host after repeated failures. Callers can fetch page text or parsed JSON and inspect rate status. No API key is defined.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-16","lib/index.js:93-164","lib/index.js:170-277"]}
